### ========================================
### SUCCESS CASES - 200 OK
### ========================================

### Technology news
GET http://localhost:5002/api/news?query=technology

###

### Business news
GET http://localhost:5002/api/news?query=business

###

### Health news
GET http://localhost:5002/api/news?query=health


### ========================================
### VALIDATION ERRORS - 400
### ========================================

### Missing query parameter
GET http://localhost:5002/api/news

###

### Empty query parameter
GET http://localhost:5002/api/news?query=

###

### Whitespace query parameter
GET http://localhost:5002/api/news?query=%20%20%20


### ========================================
### EMPTY RESULTS - 200 OK
### ========================================

### Query that is unlikely to return results
GET http://localhost:5002/api/news?query=xyzabc123unlikelyquery


### ========================================
### EXTERNAL API ERRORS
### ========================================

### These scenarios are tested automatically
### through NewsControllerTests because they
### cannot be reliably reproduced through a normal URL.

### 502 Bad Gateway
### Happens when NewsAPI returns an HTTP error
### such as 401/403 or another upstream failure.

### 504 Gateway Timeout
### Happens when the external NewsAPI request
### is cancelled or times out.

### 500 Internal Server Error
### Happens when an unexpected exception occurs.